DTEND:20261230T090000
SUMMARY:[RW] Ride with cadence drills (150 min)
DESCRIPTION:10 min warm-up\; 114 min easy\; 6 x (0.5 min steady + 2.5 min 
 easy)\; 8 min cool-down. Six short high-cadence spins (about 100 rpm\, sm
 ooth)\, easy between. Skill\, not strength. Do not do this right before a
  run: high cadence raises the cost of the run that follows (Walsh 2019).\
 n\nWeek 6 (BASE). Not medical advice\; pain that changes how you move mea
 ns stop.\nrampwise-plan
