DTEND:20270128T072500
SUMMARY:[RW] Swim: main set (8 x 3 min) (55 min)
DESCRIPTION:8 min easy swim + kick\; 6 min drills\; 8 x (3 min tempo + 0.5
  min recovery)\; 5 min cool-down. Steady-hard repeats (RPE 6)\, even pace
  from the first to the last. Swim time and effort\, not distance: pools a
 nd paces differ. If you know your 100 m time\, convert the minutes to met
 res. Rest 15-30 s between repeats.\n\nWeek 10 (BUILD). Not medical advice
 \; pain that changes how you move means stop.\nrampwise-plan
